    <briefdescription>
<para>These routines retrieve the axis specifications associated with the memory domains. The domain is a derived type with private elements. These routines retrieve the axis specifications associated with the memory domains. The 2D version of these is a simple extension of 1D. <linebreak/>
Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
